{"candidateAnswer":"July 2023","evidence":"[D16:3 | 2:15 pm on 21 June, 2023] Gina: Thanks! This hoodie isn't for sale, it's from my own collection. I made a limited edition line last week to show off my style and creativity - it was tough but worth it!","itemId":"urn:uuid:6d13c5e6-2b2c-51b5-8adf-e9de2348bd6c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ac3fa2ae5efc749beeb1e4500759daecebff32c6daac46d09d1a0cde80ecd4c1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Gina design a limited collection of hoodies?","referenceAnswer":"June 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ac3fa2ae5efc749beeb1e4500759daecebff32c6daac46d09d1a0cde80ecd4c1"}}]}